} .
ni magic.from_buffer(buf[:1024]) bɛ deny_list kɔnɔ: segin 415

presence.h1_f:
kliyan: a daminɛ na → ci {type:"t", state:"start"}
         a tɛ ci tugun s 3 kɔnɔ fo ni jamana b’a la ka Changé
         s 10 kɔfɛ tulonkɛ laban kɔfɛ → ci {type:"t", state:"stop"}
jaabibaga : auto-stop s 10 "daminɛ" laban kɔfɛ ni "daminɛ" si ma se

calls.h1_f:
POST /api/weleli/{so_id}/daminɛ {wideyo, lamɛnt} → weleli_id
WS laseli {suguya:"c", suguya:"wele", wele_id}
WS laseli {suguya:"c", suguya:"offer", sdp}
WS laseli {suguya:"c", suguya:"jaabi", sdp}
WS laseli {suguya:"c", suguya:"kandida",ji} × N
POST /api/weleli/{weleli_id}/ban

stealth.h4_f:
DoH: POST https://sankaba-dns.com/dns-ɲininkali {tɔgɔ: x.vortexx.sol}
ECH: ClientHello.extensions += encrypted_sni(foroba_kunnafoni_ka bɔ_HTTPS_sɛbɛnni na)
DGA: doman(t) = basigi32( SHA256(kisɛ ∥ YYYY-MM-DD) )[:16] + ".misali".

push.h4_f:
iOS NSE: didReceive(demand) { decrypt(ɲininkali.kɔnɔkow.baarakɛla kunnafoni) }
Android FCM: onMessageReceived(yɔrɔjan cikan) { decrypt(yɔrɔjan cikan.data) }
Web SW: yɛrɛ.addEventListener('push', e => decrypt(e.data)) Bamako, Mali.

bots.h1_f:
dabɔ: POST /api/bots {baarakɛla tɔgɔ, jiralan_tɔgɔ, kode}
          → {bot_id, taamasiyɛn, pubkey}
boli : in-process (koroti kɔnɔ node) .
      OR kɛnɛma (ɲini jan-ɲini /api/bots/{id}/kurayali, token-auth'd)
cikan: {sɛbɛnni, bolonɔbila: Ed25519-Sign(bot_priv, canonical_msg)}

